<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Canberra gains A$70 mln from Telstra div - govt.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Canberra gains A$70 mln from Telstra div - govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Monday the government will gain A$70 million in fiscal 1996/97 from a higher-than-expected dividends from state telcoms carrier Telstra Corp.</p>
<p>&quot;The dividend that it will be paying in the 1996/97 year ... will be of the order of about A$1.37 billion,&quot; Costello told parliament.</p>
<p>&quot;The budget is predicated on a dividend payment in the order of A$1.30 billion.&quot;</p>
</text>
